<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
<Document>
<name>SINS OF OUR FATHERS mission map — detailed rev2</name>
<description>Normalized geometry-and-notes transcription of the owner detailed KML. 138 placemarks: 131 points, 6 LineStrings, 1 Polygon. Core continuity corrections applied 2026-08-07. Planning/reference geometry only.</description>
<Placemark><name>Crimson Two's position</name>
<description>Lawrence "Rip" Mansell occupies a mobile observation tower near the sundial on the islands highest point of elevation. After defeating him, the player can find EXTREME PREJUDICE set up in his observation post, near his now dead body.</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.8257476,18.2997155,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Covert floatplane landing location</name>
<description>This is where smoke coast the plane to a landing with an engine off allowing Victor Two Bravo to access the island undetected via an unlit disused boat launch..</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.8228,18.2977615,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Concealed staging area</name>
<description>The team make their way here to allow Tripper to asses physical and network security measures that the team should be aware of, and to allow time for the team to review, finalize, and agree on the mission objective approach plan.</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.8233874,18.298763,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Temple Pavilion</name>
<description>This eclectically and expensively decorated pavilion styled to look like an Egyptian temple contains a secure office used by Goldberg. Inside, the player can find Intel collectibles, and the other CheyTac M200 Intervention sniper rifle. The rifle can be used to defeat Rip from a distance.</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.8281808,18.298149,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Western cape pool house flagpole base stash location.</name>
<description>This is where the player may find Regent's Intel dead drop, hidden behind a loose stone block in the flag pole base near the pool house. Cache details: weatherproof cache or sealed container;one encrypted USB drive;handwritten note;unfamiliar symbol;coordinates that do not correspond to a Game 1 objective;no signature. the player can reveal the location of this stash by collecting and piecing together the coordinate fragments scattered across 8 benches on the island</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.8285678,18.3012709,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Crimson Three's position</name>
<description>The player approaches along the eastern beach using foliage for cover from drones. The main access route is too heavily surveilled and protected from automated weapons systems for the team to risk. Therefore the team decide to work around to the northwestern guesthouse/service side of the main-residence property and use the guesthouse service entrance. This guesthouse also contained a concealed security monitoring room, where the player can access the video feed, and with an access card that they can acquire after defeating Dermot "Lucky" Underwood, also switch the IFF threat-detection profiles of the automated systems inside the main residence and its courtyard to turn those systems against Crimson One, who is positioned inside the main-residence entry hall on the mezzanine level. The exact result remains an encounter-implementation choice: the IFF-assisted route may suppress, injure, displace, or defeat Graves, while direct combat remains valid. The guest house is where the player is confronted by Crimson Three. Shortly after the team enter the guesthouse, which they find unlit and seemingly deserted, Underwood attacks them using a stun grenade, which leads to a frantic close quarters firefight inside the disorienting interior of the guest house. After defeating Underwood, the player can take his access card and unlock the security room.mentioned earlier.</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.8246303,18.3034407,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Crimson One's position</name>
<description>The mezzanine on the first floor level of the main residence's entry hall is where the player finds Graves expecting him, already in cover. Unless the player tampers with the IFF settings beforehand, trying to defeat Graves in a full-on fight is tricky and rewarding challenge. The player can also find many Intel collectibles by searching the large residence before proceeding to the helipad for the final part of the mission.</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.8242926,18.302896,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Final helipad confrontation location</name>
<description>The player moves through the main residence's courtyard and across the driveway to the helipad where the team confronts Goldberg and Stockbridge as they are preparing to escape off the island, only for CIA Director Macmillan to interdict via radio, ordering the team to stand down and let Goldberg and Stockbridge flee the island in a helicopter. Spook refuses, which leads to Bishop declaring Victor Two Bravo rogue, ending the campaign finale on a cliffhanger, while the targets escape.</description>
<Point><coordinates>-64.8235337,18.3025516,0</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Boath launch access point</name>
<Point><coordinates>-64.8226906,18.2978334,15.5396195</coordinates></Point>
</Placemark>
